{"4255340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wind Tunnel Flight Lab", "steam_appid": 4255340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind Tunnel Flight Lab is an interactive physics sandbox that lets you experiment with how objects move in a vertical wind tunnel using real aerodynamic principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a cube, sphere, or a fully controllable human into the tunnel and watch the forces come alive. Adjust physical parameters in real time and see exactly <i>why</i> objects rise, fall, or hover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here to learn, experiment, or just mess around with physics, Wind Tunnel Flight Lab is built to be both educational and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic, Intermediate, and Advanced controls are available for players of all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/d6e45c2faab0f12623ef9518868c5257.avif?t=1769563720\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the forces acting on objects as they move through the air, including Gravity, Drag, Net force and acceleration. All values are visualized on screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change key parameters on the fly: Object mass and size, Air density, Wind speed, and Gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of Banana Man, a fully controllable human character:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust body position to control lift and stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how posture affects airflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimic real-world belly flight techniques used in wind tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter &quot;Infinite Flight&quot; mode and watch the clouds pass by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/9cb34b8b4a1c28701383c8383f229f56.avif?t=1769563720\" width=524 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interested in play? Complete challenges and play &quot;Flappy Wind&quot; to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/4ba56df4b06c306123816a62ad06ee89.avif?t=1769563720\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind Tunnel Flight Lab is an interactive physics sandbox that lets you experiment with how objects move in a vertical wind tunnel using real aerodynamic principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a cube, sphere, or a fully controllable human into the tunnel and watch the forces come alive. Adjust physical parameters in real time and see exactly <i>why</i> objects rise, fall, or hover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here to learn, experiment, or just mess around with physics, Wind Tunnel Flight Lab is built to be both educational and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic, Intermediate, and Advanced controls are available for players of all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/d6e45c2faab0f12623ef9518868c5257.avif?t=1769563720\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the forces acting on objects as they move through the air, including Gravity, Drag, Net force and acceleration. All values are visualized on screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change key parameters on the fly: Object mass and size, Air density, Wind speed, and Gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of Banana Man, a fully controllable human character:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust body position to control lift and stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how posture affects airflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimic real-world belly flight techniques used in wind tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter &quot;Infinite Flight&quot; mode and watch the clouds pass by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/9cb34b8b4a1c28701383c8383f229f56.avif?t=1769563720\" width=524 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interested in play? Complete challenges and play &quot;Flappy Wind&quot; to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/extras/4ba56df4b06c306123816a62ad06ee89.avif?t=1769563720\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Wind Tunnel Flight Lab is an interactive physics sandbox where you experiment with real aerodynamics in a vertical wind tunnel. Adjust air, gravity, mass, and size to make objects—and a fully controllable human—rise, fall, and fly. Learn, experiment, and play.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255340/968f66d7633c51447847e94a7e12c4d3735119e2/header.jpg?t=1769563720", "